# Reference materials (update_research/) — committed by default for
# backup + Claude-Code context (private repo, see update_research/README.md
# and CLAUDE.md §12). Excluded: pre-built binary executables shipped
# inside vendored reference repos (Linux-specific blobs, useless on other
# machines, push individual files near GitHub's >50 MB warn threshold).
update_research/**/stockfish-*-x86-64-*
update_research/**/*.exe
# Windows NTFS "downloaded from internet" metadata sidecars — appear when
# copying files from Windows to WSL; pure noise. Delete on disk too.
*:Zone.Identifier
